# ========================================
# ===== SYSTEM-TICKETS Http =====
# ========================================
# ----- 先执行 02-session.http 登录（需要 System Admin 权限） -----
# ----- lab 固定项目名 dc-portal-http-suite：GET 捕获 id；不存在则自动 POST 创建（201/409） -----

# ========================================
# ===== 项目管理 =====
# ========================================

### 获取项目列表并绑定 lab 项目 id（dc-portal-http-suite）
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/system/tickets/projects?includeArchived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# @expect 201,409
### 创建 lab 工单项目（名称冲突 409 时依赖上一步 GET 已捕获 id）
POST {{addr}}/api/admin/system/tickets/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "dc-portal-http-suite",
  "description": "Portal HTTP 集成测试专用项目"
}

> {%



const payload = response.body;
if (payload?.data?.id) {
  client.global.set("testProjectId", String(payload.data.id));
  client.log(`Stored testProjectId=${payload.data.id}`);
}



%}

# @expect 200,404,409
### 更新 lab 项目描述
PATCH {{addr}}/api/admin/system/tickets/projects/{{testProjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": "Portal HTTP 集成测试（自动更新）"
}

# @manual
### 归档 lab 项目（归档后不能在其中建单，返回 409）
PATCH {{addr}}/api/admin/system/tickets/projects/{{testProjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isArchived": true
}

# 工单创建 / 用户 CRUD / 删除见 21-tickets.http；管理员批量删等见该文件末尾。

# @manual
### 删除 lab 项目（需无未删除工单，否则 409；套件默认保留项目 dc-portal-http-suite）
DELETE {{addr}}/api/admin/system/tickets/projects/{{testProjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
